                                                "sense_id": "11d8fde7-bd3b-3b80-86c8-f977d835b013",
                                                "text": "I take back cars from dildos who don't pay their bills. Cool huh?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "efb2a9c9-8b4b-4e60-829e-86a4dbc56888",
                                                "sense_id": "11d8fde7-bd3b-3b80-86c8-f977d835b013",
                                                "text": "‘Thompson?’ Heydon-Bayley had shrieked. ‘But he’s a complete dildo, surely?’\n ‘I like him,’ said Adrian, ‘he’s unusual.’\n ‘Graceless, you mean. Wooden.’"
                                            }
