                                                "sense_id": "765f8023-a72e-367f-bfc5-172581666310",
                                                "text": "The commonest and most conspicuous of the cacti is the \"dildoe\" (Cereus Swartzii), a columnar form growing to as much as 20 feet in height, a plant the gross physiology of which is probably very similar to that of the sahuaro (Camegiea gigantea)."
